OL,3,AUK drone factories may face attacks
OL,4,Afrom 'unknown sources', says Kremlin
OL,5,Aadviser
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said that while the details were not
OL,8,F"fully confirmed", it is "likely" he
OL,9,Fwill go. The trip would be his first to
OL,10,Fthe US since becoming prime minister in
OL,11,FJuly.
OL,13,F"Leaving today, I'm quite clear what I
OL,14,Fneed to do in the next few weeks," he
OL,15,Fsaid following his official visit to
OL,16,FUkraine on Monday, during which he
OL,17,Fpromised to continue pressuring Russia.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
